  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，这池子可过不去啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
